# The Champion of Johto (HeartGold's SEQ_GS_VS_CHAMP, for Lance): a fanfare on the dominant, then a soaring trumpet in
# F minor over syncopated brass, a running piano, octave bass and a pounding kit, the League's last battle. Original
# composition for this game (plan 20 · J10, part b).
title Battle! Champion (Johto)
tempo 180
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.2

